  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Ebook Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is an ebook landing page?\", \"a\": \"An ebook landing page is a single page that offers one ebook and collects what it takes to send it. For a free book that is an email address; for a paid one, a payment. It shows the cover and the contents, with one form or one buy button.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make a landing page for an ebook?\", \"a\": \"Settle the headline and the form fields first, then build. With Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a>, you describe the ebook and its reader in a prompt. Emergent builds the page and the delivery email together. To change the copy afterward, send another prompt.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are some good ebook landing page examples?\", \"a\": \"Page builders publish roundups, and design galleries collect concept shots. The ebook landing page examples worth copying show the cover large and keep the form on the first screen. Check one more thing a screenshot cannot show: what the reader receives after the click.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find an ebook landing page template?\", \"a\": \"Page builders include them with their plans, and template marketplaces sell them one at a time. An ebook landing page template gives you a layout, but the delivery email and the list behind the form are still yours to connect. Emergent starts from a prompt instead and builds the delivery along with the page.\"}, {\"q\": \"What sections does a landing page ebook template need?\", \"a\": \"Beyond the headline and the form, look for two parts that are easy to leave out. An author line says why the writer knows the subject, and a reader quote gives the page a second voice. A landing page ebook template without room for either asks readers to trust the cover alone.\"}, {\"q\": \"What makes a good ebook landing page design?\", \"a\": \"Order and contrast. The headline and the cover should be the first things a visitor sees, and the button should carry the one accent color on the page. Good ebook landing page design also keeps the form in view on a phone, without a long block of copy above it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should an e-book landing page sell the book or send it free?\", \"a\": \"Give it away when the book's job is to start a sales conversation, and charge when the book is the product. An e-book landing page for a paid title needs a checkout and a link released only after payment. Emergent builds either version from a prompt, and the readers stay in a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you make a lead magnet ebook landing page turn readers into customers?\", \"a\": \"Through the steps after the request. A lead magnet ebook landing page starts the relationship. The thank you page right after the form can offer one small next step, such as a 15-minute call or a related checklist. Readers who skip it still get the follow-up emails.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the right length for an ebook landing page?\", \"a\": \"As long as the price asks for. A free ebook needs about one screen of copy before the form, since an email address is a small ask. A paid ebook earns a longer page, with a few sample pages above the buy button and a refund line beside it.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is an ebook or a webinar the better offer to build a landing page around?\", \"a\": \"An ebook suits readers who want the material now, and a webinar suits people who want to ask questions live. The ebook arrives right after the form is sent, while a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/webinar-landing-page'>webinar landing page</a> asks people to keep an hour free. One recorded session can feed both offers.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
